{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_quickstart_composer_validation_guide", "label": "Quickstart: validar compositor nativo Groovy (golden-file workflow)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/quickstart.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_quickstart_golden_file_diff", "label": "Golden-file byte-equivalence check (diff + SHA-256)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/quickstart.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Diff and SHA-256 against a golden file captured before the migration prove the composer produces exactly what the bash produced \u2014 running integration tests alone would be hoping for the best; this was the primary objective criterion (Success Metric #3)."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_quickstart_tty_independence", "label": "TTY-independence validation (headless CI)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/quickstart.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The build must run on a CI Linux agent without TTY and on macOS without GNU sed \u2014 validated with stdin redirected from /dev/null (or NUL) and zero read -n 1 -s in the pipeline."}, {"id": "specs_002_native_groovy_composer_quickstart_new_flag_addition_flow", "label": "Add-new-flag flow (under 5 minutes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/002-native-groovy-composer/quickstart.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new capability needs only property-NN-*.xml plus variables-NN-*.groovy and snippet-NN-*.groovy; the dynamic folders (variables/generators/snippets) enter automatically in NN order \